    "updated_at": "2022-01-14T02:25:12Z",
    "body": "Am I correct that with the change above we can consider this issue closed because `releaseLock()` functions as an \"abort\" method for `read()` which doesn't abort the whole stream. What is the status of implementation of this behavior in browsers?",
